*.bin
*.pkl
*.joblib
# Exception: these are required application assets (pretrained embedding
# model weights embedding_backend loads at runtime), not local dev
# caches/output - the broad "models"/"*.pt"/"*.pkl" excludes above were
# silently stripping them from every Docker build context, so the actual
# COPY in embedding_backend/Dockerfile had nothing to copy and every
# embedding job failed with "Missing required local model files".
!apps/embedding_bundle/models
!apps/embedding_bundle/models/**
# Same issue, second occurrence: affinity_backend's trained checkpoint
# (apps/affinity/gene_embeddings.pth) was also silently excluded by the
# bare "*.pth" pattern above - every prediction failed with
# "Checkpoint not found".
!apps/affinity/**

